    "title": "#AUS小屋",
    "cate": 8,
    "author": "塞壬唱片",
    "content": "<p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"3b55d6805e27cadb6596c38bdcd2a72a\" title=\"图片.png\" alt=\"图片.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/siren/pic/20211129/3b55d6805e27cadb6596c38bdcd2a72a.png\"/></div><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\">又到了一月一度的AUS小屋栏目， </span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\">这次由我，aya，来和大家分享近况。 </span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\">不知道为什么，alty又开始下厨了。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"> 她一本正经地要教frost做烤饼干，</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"> 于是我赶紧拉着dan躲了出去。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"> 在厨房发出两次迷之爆炸声后，</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"> dan很兴奋地冲了进去，吃到了刚出炉的曲奇。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"> frost和alty也很认真地在流理台前交流着，</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"> ……可是烤箱被炸掉了啊，为什么没人在意一下？！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"> 看来只能由我来善后了，唉。</span></span></p>",
    "date": "2021-11-26"
  }
}